;;; EXERCISE

#|
Make a short sketch of minimum 5 measures for 2 cellos:

First cello with random harmonics (between the 3rd and 
9th overtone) on the C string (c1).

Second cello random harmonics (between the 2nd and 
8th overtone) on the G string (g1).

Use any durations and dynamics.
|#

